# Wave H.m — Workspace-owner shell typing

## Problem

Wave H.i.b neutralized the **URL** (`/settings/workspace-owner`) but the shell still read as Urban product code:

- File `urban-settings-access.ts`
- Page export `UrbanSettingsPage`
- Import `UrbanOwnerSettingsPanel`
- i18n namespace `settings.urban`
- Contract render token `"UrbanOwnerSettingsPanel"`

Hostile audit blocker #6: path neutralization without type neutralization is false decoupling.

## Decision

| Concern | Before | After |
| ------- | ------ | ----- |
| Access re-export module | `urban-settings-access.ts` | `workspace-owner-settings-access.ts` |
| Page default export | `UrbanSettingsPage` | `WorkspaceOwnerSettingsPage` |
| Panel import (shell) | `UrbanOwnerSettingsPanel` | `WorkspaceOwnerSettingsPanel` (package alias) |
| i18n | `settings.urban` | `settings.workspaceOwner` (product-blind copy) |
| Contract `URBAN_SETTINGS_ACCESS_MODULE` | `…/urban-settings-access.ts` | `…/workspace-owner-settings-access.ts` |
| Contract allowed render token | `"UrbanOwnerSettingsPanel"` | `"WorkspaceOwnerSettingsPanel"` |

**Keep Urban-named canLoad policy API** (`canLoadUrbanSettings`, `CANLOAD_URBAN_SETTINGS_PLUGIN_ID`, HTTP `/urban/settings`) — that is product policy, not shell chrome.

Package: export `WorkspaceOwnerSettingsPanel` as alias of `UrbanOwnerSettingsPanel` from the same module (no behavior change).

Legacy i18n key `settings.urban` may remain for a transition; shell page must not call it.

## Out of scope

- Renaming Phase 8 canLoad symbols / CASL surfaces
- Changing API `/urban/settings`
- Time-picker / `data-denali-wizard-*` (H.l.b)
- Install-graph isolation

## Verify

```bash
test -f apps/web/app/(app)/settings/workspace-owner/workspace-owner-settings-access.ts
test ! -f apps/web/app/(app)/settings/workspace-owner/urban-settings-access.ts
rg 'UrbanSettingsPage|settings\.urban|UrbanOwnerSettingsPanel|urban-settings-access' \
  apps/web/app/\(app\)/settings/workspace-owner
pnpm --filter @apps/web exec node --import tsx --test \
  test/urban-owner-access.spec.ts \
  test/wave-h-urban-settings-path.spec.ts \
  test/wave-h-urban-settings-colocation.spec.ts \
  test/wave-h-workspace-owner-shell-typing.spec.ts
```
